<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-15T02:54:01.135Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 02:54:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have stepped up cross-border attacks, launching missiles and drones at Saudi targets including a weapons depot near the border and Riyadh, while Saudi air defenses intercepted several missiles and a drone over eastern Saudi Arabia. In Yemen, Houthi shelling in Taiz killed a child and wounded six civilians, and a Somali refugee woman was killed in Houthi shelling of a refugee camp in Lahj. Saudi-led coalition forces have carried out air strikes across Yemen, including a claimed 72 strikes in 24 hours and strikes on Sanaa. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/11/15/iran-war-live-israel-vows-gaza-offensive-policy-despite-caretaker-status?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQS0dDczNVbDlDeWpuZUJJakhTclBjSG9aT2NucjViZ1R6a3ZBaVpwQ2tERkRCb0p5YS0yMnRyYWNzX0hsbm1Od3ZDMjhfbm11eEdhSDJQODdQMUpsNnlwZlVpRTdaMmZXLWZid2VvWGhmYTdYS2xXZmlJZ2M5QWNqem5BN21yVC1QUjZ3TkR5WjIwU3BYQkUwcnVWaUJkZUFNNXp0cDJHM0NyMmNjaXZGbHhIT05Rdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNUmc3bU9ZUDg2RXRkakdkakd0TE90YVFqalh1MXBRZThtYWQ3YkVGWndIT3ZFb0NZQnFHQlFobk1SZVRKTDQyajhpelNocEJ6NTZST3ZlNGYyRVpBTWxkUUtRczQ0ZHZtNkRFZjQ4VUt0N1RPUjNIdV8wN3pTLUpXSUQ2Z3NPcXdsbV9fMUNocG9BenppWUVIX3BMaUVNWmRKZFVobF9ma0hWNWkzdWZkMTRtRTRsWkI1Y2lzNTlnMFpYdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTFBteWo4d3lhYUFuSmxYV3VzTXk4S0dZNEVzVzUzbU9uREo2WmxuT3ZKcXdjRU0tOWhTdl9NVmhSZXNOMXdEbE9IdG13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBM